	(text "I_chg = (1000 V / R3) x (1.2 - 4 I/3) = 260 mA.  CHRG -> MCU, R10 pull-up (its done-state pull-down is weak).\nU7 pin 5 on 3V3, not VBUS: the C6 pulls D+ up while unplugged and would back-feed VBUS.\nVBUS_SENSE = 0.61 x VBUS (3.0 V at 5 V): plugged in, charging or full."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 184.15 0)
