	(text "EN: 10k / 1u power-on delay (Espressif).  IO9 = BOOT (SW1).  IO8 strap high via R16.\nIO0/IO1: 32.768 kHz crystal for the light-sleep RTC.  IO12/13: USB Serial/JTAG on the charging port.\nADC1: IO2 MOT_IPROPI, IO6 VBAT_SENSE.  LP (deep-sleep wake): IO7 ACC_INT1."
