	(text "MSKSEMI part, not ST: WHO_AM_I 0x11, LIS2DH-style register map. INT2 unused: route wake and tap to INT1.\nCS and SDO/SA0 open (internal pull-ups): I2C, address 0x19.  C10 at VDD, C11 at VDDIO.\nPin 4: NC in the pin table, GND in its connection column for every mode, so grounded."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 287.02 224.79 0)
