	(text "One board for all three toys (bird / fish / ball). 1S LiPo, protected or not.\n\nBattery voltage: VBAT_SENSE (IO6, ADC1_CH6), VBAT / 2.\nOn charger: VBUS_SENSE (IO19). Charging: CHG_STAT (IO20), low = charging.\nMotor current: MOT_IPROPI (IO2, ADC1_CH2), 0 dB attenuation.\nGAINSEL: drive low / drive high / input-disconnected = Hi-Z.\nMotor PWM = drive/brake: fwd IN1=1, IN2=1-duty; rev IN2=1, IN1=1-duty.\nMotor: IN1 IO3, IN2 IO4, GAINSEL IO14.  Speaker: SPK_PWM IO5.  Status LED: LED_STATUS IO23.\n\nTest points: value = back-silk label. TX/RX = UART0, 3.3 V. BOOT low + EN pulse = download mode.\nHand-soldered, not JLC-assembled: J3 battery (JST-PH, the plug cells come with).\nAntenna: 2.4 GHz FPC antenna on the module u.FL, plugged in by hand.\nH1, H2: M2 mounting holes (NPTH), diagonal corners; ISO 7380 button head (3.5 mm)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 208.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "da645234-5efc-5a9b-810d-71001cca767a")
	)
